 kamu kera yang hina\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلِمْتُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱعْتَدَوْا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d0c9dc335af7c948ebea.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "prekršili su", "en": "they transgressed", "tr": "haddi aştılar", "fr": "ils transgressèrent", "id": "mereka melampaui batas", "ur": "انہوں نے زیادتی کی", "bn": "তারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে", "fa": "تجاوز کردند"}}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّبْتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَقُلْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُونُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قِرَدَةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَٰسِـِٔينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ٱعْتَدَىٰ", "count": 4, "first": "2:178", "audio": "audio/9bce6e7bf02be552df9a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it transgressed", "bs": "prekoračio je granice", "tr": "sınırı aştı", "fr": "il a transgressé les limites", "id": "dia telah melampaui batas", "ur": "اُس نے سرکشی کی", "bn": "সে সীমা লঙ্ঘন করল", "fa": "از حد گذشت"}}, {"arabic": "يَعْتَدُونَ", "count": 3, "first": "2:61", "audio": "audio/f6e505a340a5f6189e4b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they transgress", "bs": "prekoračuju granice", "tr": "sınırları aşarlar", "fr": "ils transgressent les limites", "id": "mereka melampaui batas", "ur": "وہ سرکشی کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সীমা লঙ্ঘন করে", "fa": "از حد می‌گذرند"}}, {"ara